  data: {
    LLM: 'Game: U-G-O. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: "U-G-O is a card battle game for 2-8 players where each player uses their own deck. Cards are played vertically (attack) or horizontally (defense). Defense may be face-up or face-down. Goal: exhaust your opponent's deck before yours runs out. Special abilities on Aces, Kings, Queens, Jacks, 8s, 9s, and 10s; Equip cards (Diamonds).",
    objective: 'To make your opponent(s) run out of cards in their deck before you run out of cards in your deck.',
    gameplay: "Draw 1/turn. Play cards vertically (attack) or horizontally (defense). Attack opponent's cards with higher values. Destroyed cards go to discard. Special: 2s, 3s, 7s, 10s have abilities. Lose when unable to draw.",
